<title>RUSSIA: Russia two-year OFZ bond average price 90.03 pct.</title>
<headline>Russia two-year OFZ bond average price 90.03 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 2.50 trillion rouble issue of two-year OFZ interest-bearing bond maturing in October 1998 was priced at an average 90.03 percent, the central bank said.</p>
<p>At the last auction of OFZ bonds on September 18, a new tranche of two-year bonds maturing in March 1998 was priced at an average 91.07 percent.</p>
